### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Swagger document
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger.json

### ==================== Users CRUD ====================

### Create user

POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Alex Student",
    "email": "alex.student@example.com",
    "password": "Campus123!",
    "role": "user"
}

### Get all users
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

### Get user by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}

### Update user

PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Alex Updated"
}

### Delete user
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}

### ==================== Events CRUD ====================

### Create event
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Campus Technology Fair",
    "description": "Students present technology projects to the campus community.",
    "category": "Technology",
    "startDate": "2026-08-15T15:00:00.000Z",
    "endDate": "2026-08-15T18:00:00.000Z",
    "venueId": "{{venueId}}",
    "organizerId": "{{userId}}",
    "capacity": 150,
    "status": "published",
    "imageUrl": "https://example.com/events/technology-fair.jpg"
}

### Get all events
GET {{baseUrl}}/events

### Filter events
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?status=published&category=Technology

### Get event by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}

### Update event
PUT {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "capacity": 200,
    "status": "published"
}

### Delete event
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/events/{{eventId}}
